    IDS_QUERY_VALUE "Invalid condition: check the value type, range or format"
    IDS_QUERY_LIMIT "Query exceeds the supported length or complexity"
    IDS_SEARCH_HELP_TITLE "Search syntax"
    IDS_SEARCH_HELP "Quick search matches names, constant values and GUIDs.\n\nConditions:\nname contains ""access"" and value = 5\nvalue contains ""Windows""\nvalue >= 1.45 and value < 1.55\nvalue = nan or value = inf\n\nUse AND, OR, NOT and parentheses. Strings need double quotes.\nFields: name, fullname, value, guid, namespace, category, source, architecture.\nText: =, contains, starts_with; names also support fuzzy.\nnamespace within ""Windows.Win32"" includes child namespaces.\nsource = 0 selects the first input. architecture = ""x86"" means applicable to x86.\n\nIntegers, floats and strings are distinct: 5, 5.0, ""5"".\nFloat boundaries are rounded to the constant's declared type.\nnan matches any NaN; inf and -inf match signed infinity.\nNaN cannot be an ordered bound. NOT includes missing fields."
    IDS_INVALID_CONDITION_QUERY "Invalid condition syntax"
    IDS_SEARCH_TIP_QUICK "Search names, constant values and GUIDs.\nExamples: CrtFlW, 5, 1.5, Windows\nFor combined conditions, select Conditions.\nFull syntax: Help > Search syntax."
